   1+ 0000              ; =========================================================================
   2+ 0000              ; PROJECT126 — ATM Turbo 2+ / NeoGS host-side IPC driver
   3+ 0000              ; Version: P126_ATM_IPC v0.3.0
   4+ 0000              ;
   5+ 0000              ; This is ATM Z80 code. It runs on the 7 MHz host CPU.
   6+ 0000              ; NeoGS is an independent Z80 and has its own private debug port #EF.
   7+ 0000              ;
   8+ 0000              ; The implementation follows the proven Project125 host transport v2
   9+ 0000              ; handshake semantics. It intentionally contains no NeoGS-local IN/OUT
  10+ 0000              ; and does not program DMA_MOD/HAD/MAD/LAD/CST from the ATM side.
